                              |GKBMONKEY WHIP
|YK0================================================================

|YKB'The dimunitive monkey conceals great strength.'|WKO - |RKBMistress
Jin Lotus|WKO

|YKOWhile in the Monkey Form, you can use your speed and strength to
make a powerful throw, grabbing your opponent, and slamming him 
against a wall. After being slammed against the wall, your foe
will need some time to recover from the blow.  However if your
opponent is better skilled than you are, they can counter
your throw, and reverse it into a powerful headbutt. Monkey
Whip can only be used in a room with walls; it cannot be used in
the open.

|MKBThis is a Master of the South Wind power.

